{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4216408","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年宝可梦GO亮相E3","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-06-16","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon GO","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4216408/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"E3现场直播中，增田分享宝可梦GO的捕捉玩法、音乐与音效，并介绍宝可梦GO Plus即将发售。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモン"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon GO","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4216408.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160617141454id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4216408.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n日本时间凌晨2点播出的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Treehouse Live @ E3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好像有很多很多人观看了，\n真的很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从 E3 任天堂会场\n进行了直播！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n增田坐的椅子上拍的照片！聚起了人群！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                增田聊了聊\n捕捉宝可梦时的讲究，\n以及自己负责音乐和音效这件事\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n关于与\n宝可梦 太阳·月亮的\n关系\n\n<br>\n\n\n聊了聊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宫本先生为我们介绍的\n宝可梦 GO Plus\n\n<br>\n\n\n预计7月下旬发售！\n敬请期待！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于\n大家可以\n亲自游玩的\n时刻越来越近了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 GO\n敬请期待！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n日本の夜中の2時に放送された</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Treehouse Live @ E3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nかなり多くの方々に\n見て頂けたようで\n嬉しいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nE3 Nintendo の会場から\nLive放送されました！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nマスダの座った椅子からの写真！人だかりが！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                マスダは\nポケモンを捕まえる事のこだわりと\n音楽と効果音を担当してること\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモン サン・ムーンとの\n関係について\n\n<br>\n\n\n喋りました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宮本さんから\nお話いただいた\nPokémon GO plus\n\n<br>\n\n\n7月下旬に発売予定の事！\nお楽しみに！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいよいよ\nみなさんに\nプレイしてもらえる\nタイミングが近づいてきました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nPokémon GO\nお楽しみに！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}